@startuml
title Deployment Diagram — TelcoGuard

node "Client Browser" as Client
node "Streamlit Host" as StreamlitHost
node "API Host (AKS/ACI)" as APIHost
node "Azure ML" as AzureML
node "Postgres" as Postgres
node "Blob Storage" as Blob

Client --> StreamlitHost : HTTP
StreamlitHost --> APIHost : HTTPS / gRPC
APIHost --> AzureML : model inference
APIHost --> Postgres : read/write
APIHost --> Blob : read knowledge/data

@enduml